{"id":4667,"date":"2019-08-11T16:33:22","date_gmt":"2019-08-11T20:33:22","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/?p=4667"},"modified":"2019-08-12T01:49:36","modified_gmt":"2019-08-12T05:49:36","slug":"normandie-region-france","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/travel-log\/normandie-region-france\/","title":{"rendered":"Normandie Region, France"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Normandie definitely lives up to its reputation of being a gorgeous French region. With its gorgeous <i>falaises<\/i> (i.e. cliffs) and its quaint villages, it is the perfect escape. While the Mont-Saint-Michel Abbey is the most visited landmark in the region, don&#8217;t forget to take nice little detours to gems such as the B\u00e9n\u00e9dictine palace or a local farm. And most importantly, don&#8217;t forget to try all of Normandie&#8217;s crepes and apple ciders !<\/p>\n<div class=\"su-tabs su-tabs-style-default su-tabs-mobile-stack\" data-active=\"1\" data-scroll-offset=\"0\" data-anchor-in-url=\"no\"><div class=\"su-tabs-nav\"><span class=\"\" data-url=\"\" data-target=\"blank\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">Etretat and the Falaises<\/span><span class=\"\" data-url=\"\" data-target=\"blank\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">B\u00e9n\u00e9dictine Palace<\/span><span class=\"\" data-url=\"\" data-target=\"blank\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">Cider Farm<\/span><\/div><div class=\"su-tabs-panes\"><div class=\"su-tabs-pane su-u-clearfix su-u-trim\" data-title=\"Etretat and the Falaises\">\n<style type=\"text\/css\">\r\n\t#foogallery-gallery-4628 .fg-image {\r\n        width: 150px;\r\n    }\r\n<\/style>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"foogallery foogallery-container foogallery-default foogallery-lightbox-foobox fg-gutter-10 fg-center fg-default fg-light fg-border-thin fg-shadow-outline fg-loading-default fg-loaded-fade-in fg-caption-hover fg-hover-fade fg-hover-zoom fg-ready\" id=\"foogallery-gallery-4628\" data-foogallery=\"{&quot;item&quot;:{&quot;showCaptionTitle&quot;:true,&quot;showCaptionDescription&quot;:true},&quot;lazy&quot;:true}\" >\r\n\t<div class=\"fg-item fg-type-image fg-idle\"><figure class=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/20190810_173716.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"View of the city of Etretat with a view of the &lt;i&gt;Chambre des demoiselles &lt;\/i&gt; (i.e. the ladies&#039;&#039; room) and the &lt;i&gt;Aiguille de Belval&lt;\/i&gt; (i.e. the needle of Belval).\" data-attachment-id=\"4653\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"View of the city of Etretat with a view of the &lt;i&gt;Chambre des demoiselles &lt;\/i&gt; (i.e. the ladies&#039;&#039; room) and the &lt;i&gt;Aiguille de Belval&lt;\/i&gt; (i.e. the needle of Belval).\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2019\/08\/20190810_173716\/876457072.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22150%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20150%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><\/span><span class=\"fg-image-overlay\"><\/span><\/a><figcaption class=\"fg-caption\"><div class=\"fg-caption-inner\"><div class=\"fg-caption-title\">View of the city of Etretat with a view of the <i>Chambre des demoiselles <\/i> (i.e. the ladies'' room) and the <i>Aiguille de Belval<\/i> (i.e. the needle of Belval).<\/div><\/div><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"fg-loader\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fg-item fg-type-image fg-idle\"><figure class=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/20190810_181343.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"&lt;p&gt;Built August 6th 1856, Notre-Dame de la Garde is a church dedicated to sailors. It was destroyed during the second world war and rebuilt in 1950.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The monument behind it is in memory of a pair of pilots--Charles Nungesser and Fran\u00e7ois Coli--who attempted to fly over the ocean towards the United States on May 8th, 1927. They disappeared somewhere over the ocean.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Between these two monuments is the Heritage Museum of Etretat that explains the history of the city and the region.&lt;\/p&gt;\" data-attachment-id=\"4656\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"&lt;p&gt;Built August 6th 1856, Notre-Dame de la Garde is a church dedicated to sailors. It was destroyed during the second world war and rebuilt in 1950.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The monument behind it is in memory of a pair of pilots--Charles Nungesser and Fran\u00e7ois Coli--who attempted to fly over the ocean towards the United States on May 8th, 1927. They disappeared somewhere over the ocean.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Between these two monuments is the Heritage Museum of Etretat that explains the history of the city and the region.&lt;\/p&gt;\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2019\/08\/20190810_181343\/4233959161.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22150%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20150%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><\/span><span class=\"fg-image-overlay\"><\/span><\/a><figcaption class=\"fg-caption\"><div class=\"fg-caption-inner\"><div class=\"fg-caption-title\"><p>Built August 6th 1856, Notre-Dame de la Garde is a church dedicated to sailors. It was destroyed during the second world war and rebuilt in 1950.<\/p><p>The monument behind it is in memory of a pair of pilots--Charles Nungesser and Fran\u00e7ois Coli--who attempted to fly over the ocean towards the United States on May 8th, 1927. They disappeared somewhere over the ocean.<\/p><p>Between these two monuments is the Heritage Museum of Etretat that explains the history of the city and the region.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"fg-loader\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fg-item fg-type-image fg-idle\"><figure class=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/20190810_180027.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"The stunning &lt;i&gt;falaises&lt;\/i&gt; at Etretat include named rocks, including this one, named Roc Vaudieu. It is the remnant of a cliff.\" data-attachment-id=\"4654\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"The stunning &lt;i&gt;falaises&lt;\/i&gt; at Etretat include named rocks, including this one, named Roc Vaudieu. It is the remnant of a cliff.\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2019\/08\/20190810_180027\/2508416496.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22150%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20150%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><\/span><span class=\"fg-image-overlay\"><\/span><\/a><figcaption class=\"fg-caption\"><div class=\"fg-caption-inner\"><div class=\"fg-caption-title\">The stunning <i>falaises<\/i> at Etretat include named rocks, including this one, named Roc Vaudieu. It is the remnant of a cliff.<\/div><\/div><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"fg-loader\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fg-item fg-type-image fg-idle\"><figure class=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/20190810_182923.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"The towns near the coast are all very quaint and very well-kept. The cities are no longer well-kept secrets though so make sure to stay away from the tourist traps to really take advantage of the city.\" data-attachment-id=\"4658\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-im